[0.005, "o", "\u001b[19B\u001b[0m============================================================\u001b[21;1H Demo 1: only what the supply chain built may run\u001b[22;1H \b\n \u001b[H\u001b[22B Three images of the same repository are run in a namespace\u001b[24;1H the policy controller guards. One was built by the pipeline,\u001b[25;1H one was signed by Tekton Chains alone, one by nobody. Watch\u001b[26;1H which of them becomes a pod in the top pane.\u001b[27;1H============================================================\u001b[28;1H \u001b[H"]
